scripts/ci-status.md:3:`scripts/ci-status.sh` is the snapshot probe invoked by `scripts/ci-wait.sh`. It fetches a base ref, queries `gh pr checks --json` for the named PR, and counts commits behind that base. Defaults preserve `origin/main`; `/implement --forked` passes `--base-remote upstream --base-ref main` so staleness is measured against upstream main, not the fork's main.
