docs/linting.md:10:| [markdownlint](https://github.com/igorshubovych/markdownlint-cli) | `.md` | Markdown style enforcement (config: `.markdownlint.json`). `larch-logs/` is excluded via `.markdownlintignore` — those files are runtime artifact archives, not authoring-quality docs. |
docs/linting.md:14:| Mermaid CLI (`mmdc`) | `.md` Mermaid fences | Parses top-level Mermaid fences in changed Markdown files via `scripts/lint-mermaid-fences.sh`; local hook requires `@mermaid-js/mermaid-cli` installed or can be skipped with `SKIP=lint-mermaid-fences`. `larch-logs/` paths are excluded from the `--changed-only` file set — those are runtime artifact archives. |
docs/linting.md:158:Issue #1496 / PR #1510 added a regression block in `scripts/test-create-pr.sh` (the conditional under `if [[ -x /bin/bash ]] && /bin/bash --version | grep -qE 'version 3\.[0-9]'`) that re-runs `create-pr.sh` under the system `/bin/bash` only when that interpreter reports bash 3.x — the actual macOS system shell that triggered the empty-array `${VAR[@]}` `set -u` defect (`unbound variable` on every `gh pr view/create "${GH_REPO_ARGS[@]}"` site when `--repo` was not passed).
docs/linting.md:232:| `make test-create-pr` | Run the offline git + PATH-stub harness for `scripts/create-pr.sh`, asserting `--repo` is threaded through every `gh pr view` / `gh pr create` path used by fork-mode PR creation. A `make lint` prerequisite via the `test-harnesses-N` shard partition. |
docs/linting.md:234:| `make test-gh-pr-body-update` | Run the PATH-stub harness for `scripts/gh-pr-body-update.sh`, asserting `--repo` is threaded to `gh pr edit` and malformed repo values are rejected. A `make lint` prerequisite via the `test-harnesses-N` shard partition. |
docs/linting.md:247:| `make test-finalize-sanity-check` | Run the focused regression harness for `/implement` Step 18 cleanup target sanity checks. Exercises happy cleanup, prefix-mismatch-with-session-id-match (warns + proceeds), session-id-mismatch refusal, missing-session-id refusal, and legacy basename-only validation with a stubbed `cleanup-tmpdir.sh`. A `make lint` prerequisite via the `test-harnesses-N` shard partition. |
docs/linting.md:248:| `make test-cache-root-validation` | Run the regression harness for cache-backed session root acceptance across `cleanup-tmpdir.sh`, `implement-finalize.sh`, and `token-tally.sh`, while preserving `/tmp` and `/private/tmp` acceptance and unrelated-path rejection. A `make lint` prerequisite via the `test-harnesses-N` shard partition. |
docs/linting.md:258:| `make test-cleanup-tmpdir` | Run the regression harness for `scripts/cleanup-tmpdir.sh`'s invoke-time audit log. Exercises `scripts/test-cleanup-tmpdir.sh` with a private `TMPDIR` override, covering successful removal of a throwaway `/tmp/cleanup-test-XXXXXX` directory and exactly one parseable audit record containing timestamp, pid, ppid, parent, and dir fields. A `make lint` prerequisite via the `test-harnesses-N` shard partition. |
