scripts/tracking-issue-read.md:46:- **Producer semantics** (`/implement` Step 0.5): `ADOPTED=true` is written when a run adopts an existing tracking issue. `ADOPTED=false` is written for a fresh tracking issue. Summary comments are posted by `tracking-issue-summary.sh`; durable payloads are written through `larch-log.sh`.
