scripts/ci-status.md:5:It always exits 0. Status is communicated via three stdout lines in fixed order: `CI_STATUS=pass|fail|pending|merged|NO_CHECKS`, `BEHIND_COUNT=<N>`, `FAILED_RUN_ID=<id>` (empty when no failure). `NO_CHECKS` is emitted only when `--empty-checks-grace SECONDS` is non-zero and the checks array/text is still empty after the grace period; `ci-wait.sh` exits its loop with a bail action for that status.
